      "comment" : "Hint of the playback bar's menu that holds separate forward and backward navigation units."
    },
    "Choose the app to edit the manifest of %@ with." : {
      "comment" : "Message of the panel in which the user chooses an app to edit a book's manifest.json with. %@ is the book's title."
