      "comment" : "Name of a keyboard shortcut action, listed in Settings in the audio editor group and read by VoiceOver. Removes the selected audio and keeps it for pasting.\nName of the Edit menu's Cut command, in a sentence saying why a keyboard shortcut cannot take its key."
