    "Cycle Backward Navigation Unit" : {
      "comment" : "Name of a keyboard shortcut action, listed in Settings in the Playback group and read by VoiceOver. Changes the navigation unit (sentence, paragraph, and so on) to the previous one. Also the title of the menu command of the same name."
