    "Move to Library…" : {
      "comment" : "Name of a keyboard shortcut action, listed in Settings in the Library group and read by VoiceOver. Moves feed episodes or articles into a library folder as books of their own. Also the title of the menu command of the same name."
    },
    "Moved to %@, %@." : {
