      "comment" : "Heading of the group of playback keyboard shortcuts in Settings, and the title of the Playback menu.\nName of the Settings tab for skipping, rewinding, the end of a book, the sleep timer, and the playback controls.\nTitle of the Playback menu in the menu bar, which holds the commands that play, pause, skip, and change the speed. Only a reader window shows it."
