    "Playback stopped because TextMouth's memory grew to %@ GB while the audio played, a fault in the system's audio." : {
      "comment" : "Message on the iPhone when playback was stopped because the app's memory kept growing. %@ is the memory reached, a number such as 3.2, before \"GB\" (gigabytes)."
    },
    "Playback stopped: the audio stopped responding. Press Play to try again; if it stops again, quit and reopen TextMouth." : {
