      "comment" : "VoiceOver hint of a keyboard shortcut's key button while it waits for the new key: Escape stops recording."
    },
    "Preview Voice" : {
      "comment" : "Button of the voice sheet that speaks a sample in the chosen voice.\nTitle of the button in the Voice settings that speaks a sample sentence in the selected voice."
    },
