      "comment" : "Title of the Search Library window, which VoiceOver names it by, and the name of its command in the Edit menu's Find submenu."
    },
    "Search Library…" : {
      "comment" : "Name of a keyboard shortcut action, listed in Settings in the Library group and read by VoiceOver. Opens the window that searches the text of every book. Also the title of the menu command of the same name."
