    "Search in Book" : {
      "comment" : "Heading and navigation title of the Search in Book sheet, and the name of its command.\nName of a keyboard shortcut action, listed in Settings in the Playback group and read by VoiceOver. Searches the text of the open book. Also the title of the menu command of the same name."
    },
    "Search in book" : {
